{"id":"NandhaKishorM/laya","url":"https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya","owner":"NandhaKishorM","name":"laya","description":"Non-autoregressive System 1 decision engine. Typed choice, score and yes/no decisions over any text in a single forward pass, in 100+ languages, with a router that picks the right checkpoint per request.","description_source":"api","license":"Apache-2.0","topics":["calibration","classification","decision-model","huggingface","jev","modernbert","multilingual","nlp","python","pytorch","routing","typed-decisions","zero-shot"],"archived":false,"pushed_at":"2026-10-17T04:28:40Z","language":"Python","first_seen":"2026-10-19","last_seen":"2026-10-17","recommended":false,"recommend_count":0,"last_recommended":null,"tier":"B","score":null,"risk":null,"source":"demo","origin":"auto","kind":"model","kind_basis":"topics/tags 含 model/模型","owner_class":"community","owner_label":null,"origin_note":"自动发现","action":"收藏","status":"watching","drop_reason":null,"tags":{"领域":"其他","形态":"框架","用途":"提效","成熟度":"实验","上手难度":"轻配置","风险等级":"中"},"category":{"l1":"其他","l2":"其他工具"},"experience":{"stars":4,"score":81,"parts":{"易用性":18,"文档完整度":20,"功能成熟度":18,"维护活跃":15,"风险":10}},"tags_confidence":"inferred","stars":{"current":33211,"first":32268,"delta_total":943,"delta_7d":0,"last_snapshot":null,"snapshots":0,"github":33211,"github_at":null,"forks":2984,"created_at":"2026-09-18T04:46:33Z","open_issues":null,"delta_7d_window_days":0,"delta_7d_valid":false},"events_count":1,"note":null,"user_notes":[],"human":{"status":"complete","one_liner":"一个专门用来「做选择题」的小模型，一次计算就给答案，33 毫秒出结果，支持一百多种语言。","one_liner_src":"api+人工撰写","problem":"没有它的时候，想让 AI 判断「这封邮件该给哪个部门」「这条评论有多生气」，得调一个大模型生成一段文字再解析，慢、贵，还可能瞎编。它直接给出选项和概率，不生成文字，也就没有胡说这一说。","example":"比如客服系统收到一条投诉，它能同时判断出该分给计费组、紧急程度是「快炸了」、以及这个人有退订风险，一次调用全给出来。","feature_note":{"是什么":"一个做结构化判断的模型，装上就能用，也能作为服务提供给 AI 助手调用。","核心功能":["三种题型：选项题（该归哪一类）、打分题（有多严重）、是否题（给出 0 到 1 的概率）","能读文本、邮件、工单或结构化数据","批量一次算很多条，比一条条问快","自动识别语言并切换到对应版本","可以在自己的数据上再训练，准确率提升很明显"],"常见